# Publish only the per-run summaries. The Harbor trial artifacts (agent
# transcripts, trajectories, session recordings, dbt manifests) are ~270MB per
# run and stay out of git. Allowlist, not denylist: a new Harbor output file
# must be named here to ship, rather than leaking by default.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*/results.json
!*/run_metadata.json
!*/results.tsv
